      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<!-- ============================================\n     NUR PROTOCOL — ABOUT / FOUNDER PAGE (v2)\n     Single cohesive cream layout (no white/black block break).\n     Editorial split: text column left, photo stack right, in the\n     photos' natural aspect ratios — no forced equal-size cards.\n     The award photo is deliberately smaller within the stack so the\n     engraved plaque text is naturally too small to read, without\n     any blur/edit artifact.\n     Facts: first name only (\"Myriam\"), no surname anywhere, per the\n     user's request to stay hard to cross-reference with her\n     separate yacht brokering work.\n     ============================================ -->\n\n<style>\n  .nur-about {\n    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    background-color: #FAFAF8;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__split {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 6fr) minmax(0, 6fr);\n    gap: 72px;\n    align-items: start;\n    max-width: 1320px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 110px 40px 100px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__eyebrow {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #C8A96E;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__title {\n    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 44px);\n    font-weight: 300;\n    line-height: 1.18;\n    color: #1A1A1A;\n    margin: 0 0 28px;\n    letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__title em {\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #C8A96E;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__lead {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    color: #5A5A5A;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__lead + .nur-about__lead {\n    margin-top: 18px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__lead strong {\n    color: #1A1A1A;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Recognized list (text-based, not photo cards) ---------- */\n  .nur-about__recognized {\n    margin-top: 48px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__recognized-item {\n    padding: 22px 0;\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(200,169,110,0.25);\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__recognized-item:last-child {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(200,169,110,0.25);\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__recognized-tag {\n    display: block;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 1.8px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #C8A96E;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__recognized-title {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    color: #1A1A1A;\n    margin: 0 0 6px;\n    letter-spacing: -0.1px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__recognized-text {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: #8A8A8A;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Photo stack (natural ratios, no forced crop) ---------- */\n  .nur-about__photos {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 28px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__photo {\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(200,169,110,0.3);\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__photo img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: auto;\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__photo--award {\n    width: 52%;\n    margin-left: auto;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__photo-caption {\n    display: block;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n    color: #A0A0A0;\n    text-align: right;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Closing CTA ---------- */\n  .nur-about__cta {\n    padding: 0 40px 110px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__cta-title {\n    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px);\n    font-weight: 300;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    color: #1A1A1A;\n    margin: 0 0 28px;\n    letter-spacing: -0.4px;\n    max-width: 520px;\n    margin-left: auto;\n    margin-right: auto;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__cta-title em {\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #C8A96E;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__cta-link {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    background: #1A1A1A;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    border: 1.5px solid #1A1A1A;\n    padding: 13px 28px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: background 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease, gap 0.3s ease;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__cta-link:hover {\n    background: transparent;\n    color: #1A1A1A;\n    gap: 11px;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 900px) {\n    .nur-about__split {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      gap: 48px;\n      padding: 88px 24px 72px;\n    }\n\n    .nur-about__photos {\n      order: -1;\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 640px) {\n    .nur-about__split { padding: 64px 20px 56px; }\n    .nur-about__cta { padding: 0 20px 72px; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"nur-about\">\n\n  <div class=\"nur-about__split\">\n\n    <div class=\"nur-about__text\">\n      <span class=\"nur-about__eyebrow\">The Founder</span>\n      <h1 class=\"nur-about__title\">I spent two years helping brands sell to you<br><em>Now I'm building for you</em></h1>\n      <p class=\"nur-about__lead\">For two years, through <strong>cAIre Solutions</strong>, I built the AI agents behind some of the most advanced experiences in luxury beauty, for brands, esthetic clinics and skincare companies who wanted to understand their customers better.</p>\n      <p class=\"nur-about__lead\">And on every single project, I ran into the same wall. The brand had the data. The AI had the answers. But the woman standing in front of her mirror, overwhelmed by thirty different serums and zero real guidance, still didn't know what her own skin needed.</p>\n      <p class=\"nur-about__lead\">Nur Skincoach is what happens when I stopped building that intelligence for brands, and built it for her instead. For you.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"nur-about__recognized\">\n        <div class=\"nur-about__recognized-item\">\n          <span class=\"nur-about__recognized-tag\">Beauty World Dubai 2025</span>\n          <h3 class=\"nur-about__recognized-title\">Speaker, Next in Beauty</h3>\n          <p class=\"nur-about__recognized-text\">Invited to speak at Next in Beauty, held at the Dubai World Trade Center, on how AI closes the gap between consumers overwhelmed by information online and the products their skin actually needs.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"nur-about__recognized-item\">\n          <span class=\"nur-about__recognized-tag\">Woman Of Heart Awards</span>\n          <h3 class=\"nur-about__recognized-title\">Beauty AI Innovation Award</h3>\n          <p class=\"nur-about__recognized-text\">Presented by H.E. Dr. Desziree Richardson, recognizing the work behind the AI approach that now powers Nur Skincoach.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"nur-about__photos\">\n      <div class=\"nur-about__photo nur-about__photo--stage\">\n        <img src=\"{{ 'myriam-next-in-beauty-stage.webp' | asset_url }}\" alt=\"Myriam speaking on the Next in Beauty panel at Beauty World Dubai 2025\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"nur-about__photo nur-about__photo--award\">\n          <img src=\"{{ 'myriam-woha-award.webp' | asset_url }}\" alt=\"The Beauty AI Innovation Award trophy, Women of Heart Awards, Dubai\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"nur-about__photo-caption\">Beauty AI Innovation Award, WOHA</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"nur-about__cta\">\n    <h2 class=\"nur-about__cta-title\">The same AI thinking<br><em>now built into your mask</em></h2>\n    <a href=\"/products/nur-protocol\" class=\"nur-about__cta-link\">Shop Nur Protocol <span>&rarr;</span></a>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n",
